{"id":"d018b8faa50481e8","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-basic-machine-characterization.md","title":"Machine and Closure Characterization","display":"thm-basic-machine-characterization — Machine and Closure Characterization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-basic-machine-characterization","aliases":["68-thm-basic-machine-characterization"],"display":"thm-basic-machine-characterization — Machine and Closure Characterization","depends_on":["[[68-df-basic-machine-computation]]","[[68-df-partial-recursive-function-class]]","[[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"Propositions 5.1-5.5, 8.1, 8.3; pp.8-10,22-23 / PDF 17-19,31-32","verification_status":"source-adapted-and-derived","source_proof_status":"source-proof-and-adaptation-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-basic-machine-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-basic-machine-characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-basic-machine-characterization — Machine and Closure Characterization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"89e092f6450e5227\" href=\"?note=89e092f6450e5227\" title=\"68-df-basic-machine-computation\">68-df-basic-machine-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5f5b8b347f696f58\" href=\"?note=5f5b8b347f696f58\" title=\"68-df-partial-recursive-function-class\">68-df-partial-recursive-function-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bca7d0eca4017dc7\" href=\"?note=bca7d0eca4017dc7\" title=\"68-df-kleene-normal-form\">68-df-kleene-normal-form</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Propositions 5.1-5.5, 8.1, 8.3; pp.8-10,22-23 / PDF 17-19,31-32"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-and-derived"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-and-adaptation-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BMRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{BMRec}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"89e092f6450e5227\" href=\"?note=89e092f6450e5227\" title=\"68-df-basic-machine-computation\">68-df-basic-machine-computation</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartRec}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5f5b8b347f696f58\" href=\"?note=5f5b8b347f696f58\" title=\"68-df-partial-recursive-function-class\">68-df-partial-recursive-function-class</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^{(k)}\">\\(\\varphi_e^{(k)}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bca7d0eca4017dc7\" href=\"?note=bca7d0eca4017dc7\" title=\"68-df-kleene-normal-form\">68-df-kleene-normal-form</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BMRec}=\\mathrm{PartRec}=\\{\\varphi_e^{(k)}:e,k\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{BMRec}=\\mathrm{PartRec}=\\{\\varphi_e^{(k)}:e,k\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 5.1–5.5、8.1、8.3，印刷 pp.8–10,22–23 / PDF pp.17–19,31–32。第一方向：初始函数可执行，严格复合可通过宏顺序执行，全函数原始递归可用计数循环执行，偏最小化依次计算 g(x,y)，故闭包中每个函数可由基本机器执行。反向：原书 §§6–8 从初始函数与三类封闭性构造编码、Count、Reg、T、U，Normal Form 将每个机器函数置于任意递归闭类中。本目录新增一元 Z 不改变生成类；偏 μ 比书中关系 μ 更宽的方向由上述顺序模拟承担，而关系 μ 已是偏 μ 的特例。无效索引产生空偏函数（可由 GO TO 0 永久循环实现），故包含所有自然数索引不改变等式。已复核原书证明和本地编码变体/闭包差异的对应推导；未进行 Coq/Rocq 机器证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-basic-machine-computation","status":"resolved","id":"89e092f6450e5227","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-basic-machine-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-partial-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"5f5b8b347f696f58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-partial-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-kleene-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"bca7d0eca4017dc7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-basic-machine-computation","status":"resolved","id":"89e092f6450e5227","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BMRec}$ 见 [[68-df-basic-machine-computation]]，$\\mathrm{PartRec}$ 见 [[68-df-partial-recursive-function-class]]，$\\varphi_e^{(k)}$ 见 [[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-partial-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"5f5b8b347f696f58","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BMRec}$ 见 [[68-df-basic-machine-computation]]，$\\mathrm{PartRec}$ 见 [[68-df-partial-recursive-function-class]]，$\\varphi_e^{(k)}$ 见 [[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-kleene-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"bca7d0eca4017dc7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BMRec}$ 见 [[68-df-basic-machine-computation]]，$\\mathrm{PartRec}$ 见 [[68-df-partial-recursive-function-class]]，$\\varphi_e^{(k)}$ 见 [[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{BMRec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartRec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e^{(k)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BMRec}=\\mathrm{PartRec}=\\{\\varphi_e^{(k)}:e,k\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1876,"backlinks":[{"id":"5f5b8b347f696f58","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"对应 §§5、8.3，印刷 pp.10,23 / PDF pp.19,32。\\mathcal F 给出集合大小的明确环境，避免把交集写成未绑定的任意类量化；\\mathcal F 本身封闭，所以被交族非空。与原书从机器定义 recursive 的等价关系见 [[68-thm-basic-machine-characterization]]，不把等价性当作未经证明的定义条款。"},{"id":"fd495d9c69fc281b","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 是 [[68-df-turing-computable-function]] 的本地图灵机偏函数类，$\\mathrm{PartRec}$ 见 [[68-df-partial-recursive-function-class]]。图灵机的机器集合、输入编码、配置演化和输出规则全部取 [[68-df-turing-machine-computation]] 的固定定义。基本机器与偏递归函数类的对应见 [[68-thm-basic-machine-characterization]]。"},{"id":"9e745949a6ee96af","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartRec}$ 与多元索引 $\\varphi_e^{(k)}$ 的对应见 [[68-thm-basic-machine-characterization]]、[[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]；$\\mathrm{pair}$ 见 [[68-df-pairing-function]]。$k\\in\\mathbb N$。"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-112","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-basic-machine-characterization]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"闭包与不动点：[[68-df-partial-recursive-function-class]]、[[68-thm-basic-machine-characterization]]、[[68-thm-universal-function-theorem]]、[[68-thm-s-m-n-theorem]]、[[68-thm-shoenfield-recursion-theorem]]、[[68-thm-recursion-theorem-with-parameters]]。"}],"outgoing":["89e092f6450e5227","5f5b8b347f696f58","bca7d0eca4017dc7"]}